      "narrationText": "When she signed up for a Pacific Life \"PDX\" policy in 2019, this is the illustration she was shown. By year twenty, at an assumed rate of seven-point-one percent, her policy was projected to be worth four hundred eighteen thousand, one hundred forty-one dollars. Insurance illustrations aren't guarantees. But they're supposed to be a reasonable picture of what you're buying.",
