    {
      "id": "s6a",
      "imagePath": "nature-of-action.png",
      "narrationText": "According to the lawsuit, the reason for the gap was something called the \"Performance Factor\" — an internal multiplier Pacific Life applied to the illustrated interest rate, starting in year three of the policy.",
