    {
      "id": "s7e",
      "imagePath": "term-life-relief.png",
      "narrationText": "The court gave final approval in May. The money is scheduled to be distributed by September eleventh — this month.",
      "zoomTo": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "imagePath": "term-life-relief.png",
      "narrationText": "If you own a Pacific Life PDX policy bought in California between 2016 and 2019 — not PDX 2 — check your mail or email for a settlement notice. Contact Kroll Settlement Administration if you're not sure. If you own any indexed universal life policy — any company — ask directly, in writing: what is my policy's performance factor, multiplier, or bonus rate, and what is the guaranteed minimum? If they can't answer clearly, that's information you're entitled to. This isn't a reason to panic about every policy. It's a reason to read the actual illustration — not just the pitch.",
      "zoomTo": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1
